# "covered" was translated as 站满 ("filled"), which made players think the front row needs three people.
# The real rule: nobody may stand behind an empty cell of the same column; a whole column may be empty.
#: assets_dev/engine/ui/gameplay/mm9_formation.yml:171
msgid ""
"The front line must be covered: nobody may stand behind an empty cell."
msgstr "空格后面不能站人：某一列的前排没人，这一列后面也不能有人。"
